    "A few questions, about five minutes. Hefesto then plans your week around your goals, your time and your equipment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein paar Fragen, etwa fünf Minuten. Danach plant Hefesto deine Woche nach deinen Zielen, deiner Zeit und deiner Ausrüstung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick questions. All are optional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein paar kurze Fragen. Alle sind freiwillig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A professional cleared me": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Fachperson hat mich freigegeben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A question is still open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Frage ist noch offen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A region left out until now starts its return at step 0. To leave it, report its everyday pain under Body and answer its warning signs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine bisher ausgeschlossene Region beginnt ihre Rückkehr auf Stufe 0. Um sie zu verlassen, melde ihren Alltagsschmerz unter «Körper» und beantworte ihre Warnzeichen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
